# N8a: the nailgun at 1080p with id's nails (`r_nailbarrels 0`), at 1/4 speed (`speed
# 0.25`: a host frame of 1/240 s of game for every film frame) ("QuakeC fires"). The
# player at e1m1's start, its own eye, god mode, the status bar, the gun and the
# crosshair; `impulse 9`, `impulse 4`, then the trigger held from film second 2.1. The
# sound runs on the game's clock, slowed with the picture. The freeze on a nail's first
# frame is the edit's.

map e1m1

duration 6.4
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
speed 0.25
hud on
gun on
crosshair 1
player 480,-352,88,90
cvar r_nailbarrels 0
cvar gamma 0.8

impulse 9 at 0
impulse 4 at 0.1
attack on at 2.1

camera player

sound game
events on
